    {
      "name": "Aria-body Stealth Campaign",
      "year_published": "2020",
      "description": "Check Point Research discovered in May 2020 that Naikon had maintained continuous operations using the Aria-body backdoor. The group targeted government ministries of foreign affairs, science and technology, and state-owned companies in SEA. A key evasion tactic was using compromised government servers as C2. A malicious email from a compromised Indonesian Embassy server was sent to the office of the Premier of Western Australia.\n",
      "target_sectors": [
